The component already has the correct locale in scope — CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:915 `const locale = useLocale();` — and the sibling helper `formatDateLabel(value, locale)` (line 530) uses it: `new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale, {…})`. `formatMatchTime` is rendered in the timeline rows (line 3894), the assignment picker (line 5011-5013), the conflict drawer (line 6384) and the conflict message (line 400-408).

