messages/en.json:7779 `"participantCount": "{count} participants",` (OrganizerTournaments);
messages/en.json:8279 `"courtsConfigured": "{count} courts configured",`; messages/en.json:8620 `"step1DescCount": "{count} players registered. …",`.
The project already knows the correct ICU form: messages/en.json:1973 `"legCount": "{count, plural, =0 {No legs} other {{count} legs}}"`.

